# HTTPS for Reel (T-1018). Caddy gets a free Let's Encrypt certificate for the sslip.io name
# (it resolves to the VM's own address) and passes every request to Reel on 127.0.0.1.
# Caddy sets X-Forwarded-For itself; uvicorn trusts it only from 127.0.0.1, so the login and
# registration limits see each visitor's real address.
@HOST@ {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
